---
import EditorialShell from '../../components/EditorialShell.astro';

const currentUrl = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site ?? 'https://shivammahajan.com').href;
const structuredData = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'BlogPosting',
      '@id': `${currentUrl}#article`,
      isPartOf: { '@id': 'https://shivammahajan.com/#website' },
      headline: 'Shivam Mahajan: backend and data engineering work',
      description: 'Explore Shivam Mahajan’s backend and data engineering work through Python pipelines, ClickHouse ingestion and linked source repositories.',
      image: 'https://shivammahajan.com/peony-gold-1200x630.png',
      author: { '@id': 'https://shivammahajan.com/#shivam-mahajan' },
      publisher: { '@id': 'https://shivammahajan.com/#shivam-mahajan' },
      url: currentUrl,
      datePublished: '2026-10-05T00:00:00Z',
      dateModified: '2026-10-24T00:00:00Z'
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      '@id': `${currentUrl}#breadcrumb`,
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://shivammahajan.com/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Blog', item: 'https://shivammahajan.com/blog/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Software Developer Profile', item: currentUrl }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<EditorialShell title="Shivam Mahajan | Backend and Data Engineering Work" description="Explore Shivam Mahajan's backend and data engineering work through Python pipelines, ClickHouse ingestion and linked source repositories." eyebrow="Engineering work" heading="Backend and data engineering work" intro="A guide to Shivam Mahajan's engineering projects, implementation decisions and source code." image="/peony-gold-1200x630.png" imageAlt="Shivam Mahajan LinkedIn profile photo - antique gold peony" structuredData={structuredData}>
  <a slot="actions" href="/">Official Portfolio</a><a slot="actions" href="/resume/">View resume</a><a slot="actions" href="/projects/">See projects</a>
  <section><h2>Data ingestion and validation</h2><p>Shivam's Morgan Stanley apprenticeship involved Kafka, PySpark and Snowflake pipelines handling 5 million daily events with zero row-count loss tolerance. The <a href="/resume/">resume</a> documents that role. The <a href="https://github.com/smresponsibilities/Ingestion-Tool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ClickHouse ingestion repository</a> contains a separate project moving data between CSV files and an analytical database.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Application behavior and interfaces</h2><p><a href="/projects/productivity-caller/">Productivity Caller</a> uses native Android phone-call reminders. <a href="/projects/flight-sun-tracker/">Flight Sun Tracker</a> applies solar-position calculations to flight routes. These case studies link to the implementations and distinguish product behavior from the underlying engineering choices.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Inspect the implementation</h2><p>The <a href="/projects/">project catalog</a> links to source code and demos. The <a href="/blog/">coding journal</a> records individual problems and experiments. For a short introduction and public profile links, use <a href="/blog/shivam-mahajan/">Shivam's biography</a>; for the interactive portfolio, open the <a href="/">homepage</a>.</p></section>
</EditorialShell>
